# gic_subauroral.te — GIC-Breitenband-Familie sub-auroral (50 <= |CGM| < 60 Grad): der
#   Stufe-1-Screen ueber die 25 Stationen des Bandes. Die Bandzugehoerigkeit ist eine
#   deklarierte Ableitung aus `cgm_lat` (phi/sources.φ, per Station) und den fixierten
#   Grenzen — kein `family`-Token. Partition gemessen 2026-10-07: 154 = 31 + 25 + 98
#   (Artefakt state/river/gic-cgm-lat.tsv).
#   Lauf: .github/workflows/field-te-query.yml Job `matrix-gic-subauroral` (CI), nie lokal.
matrix gic_subauroral full
register sources
channels magnetic_field_x_aia,magnetic_field_x_ars,magnetic_field_x_bfe,magnetic_field_x_box,magnetic_field_x_brd,magnetic_field_x_czt,magnetic_field_x_esk,magnetic_field_x_eyr,magnetic_field_x_gln,magnetic_field_x_hlp,magnetic_field_x_ler,magnetic_field_x_lov,magnetic_field_x_mgd,magnetic_field_x_new,magnetic_field_x_nur,magnetic_field_x_nvs,magnetic_field_x_ott,magnetic_field_x_paf,magnetic_field_x_shu,magnetic_field_x_sit,magnetic_field_x_spg,magnetic_field_x_stj,magnetic_field_x_ups,magnetic_field_x_vic,magnetic_field_x_yak
cond none
fdr bh 0.05 over matrix
expect cells 600
lags 0,1
surrogate 10
cadence live
bin 86400
seasonal none
